     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Plus the occupancy variant of Dorazio’s model: Koshkina et al., MEE,\r\n<a href=\"https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/2041-210X.12738\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/2041-210X.12738&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792451267930000&amp;usg=AOvVaw20Kd_U06jOzndanzEU78PR\">\r\nhttps://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/2041-210X.12738</a> <u></u>\r\n<u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Also I think there is a Fithian et al. around 2015 (I think in a multi-species setting ?). And for an opposing view see\r\n<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.01322\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.01322&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792451267930000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1AtJRy4uhEZDgAHDBGOq7T\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.01322</a> <u></u>\r\n<u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Marc<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
